# Toolchain downloads — 2026-09-16: a 68MB go tarball landed in the repo tree (downloaded while shell cwd was a service dir) and was swept in by `git add -A`. Downloads never belong in the tree.
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# Report-render output: HandleGenerateReport writes PDFs to a reports/ dir
# relative to the process CWD — during go test that is the package dir
# (observed 2026-09-16: two PDFs in internal/middleware/reports/).
**/reports/*.pdf
